#: scenario8:scenario8_7271CF53_2F9D_4C71_BB5A_EFD55E3FD8B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78005f4ac6a2fd74efc54bfd9b725563ece291b4e78458a0ba1d9cb4f3e4b6ae
#. default-sha256: 7f2c741d52186fdbb2d5011c427350c04c65087a30850632b38f2a77236ffe51
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7271CF53_2F9D_4C71_BB5A_EFD55E3FD8B8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After discussions I had no part in, it was decided that my uncle would be the next head. "
"⟪k:1⟫That they weren’t confident I had the spine to do the job properly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나처럼 어수룩한 놈이 뒤를 잇는 게 불안했을걸. ⟪k:1⟫결국 ⟪k:2⟫의논 끝에 ⟪k:3⟫숙부가 후계자가 "
"됐어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_14AA6030_BFFC_4D54_8F5F_CD1BA4D4AA3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94b78fdd38a5a0fe28ceb6663f340c5eb7096c8061ba284ffd1c27419ffaa48b
#. default-sha256: 4f2fe03f47ca3ed5e8a37a74cb80d224c8ea77199c79cedff1a6460fc84b327b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_14AA6030_BFFC_4D54_8F5F_CD1BA4D4AA3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫모든 게 나도 모르는 새에 정해져서――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫솔직히 ⟪k:3⟫당혹했어. ⟪k:4⟫왜 나한테 아무 말도 "
"안 했나 싶었지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_826116EA_6045_40AC_A4A1_DE73A200E194
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18e7fd9c007b9633900d084c4ea44273465b360ca211aba6c79efec1bde15c23
#. default-sha256: d3996ad701e203762d8b051d23af5b4dea0fb32f724be40b58ec4fdeae3cadd2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_826116EA_6045_40AC_A4A1_DE73A200E194"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If it meant I could go on with my quiet life,⟪k:1⟫I didn’t care who they picked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 하던 대로 평화롭게 살 수 있다면…… ⟪k:1⟫그냥 ⟪k:2⟫뭐든 상관없었지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A7480C5_2579_4E5D_BD3A_355A5A2BB7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e217005a4a121ea9917577d2d3eeff9ec18640501e2f5f180a480161ab9be9d
#. default-sha256: be5c7b8f1e4804dbbcf214fc47c5252dc76498ba1888c75badff4a19c3476d96
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A7480C5_2579_4E5D_BD3A_355A5A2BB7BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My uncle, though, seemed to have caught on to my apathy,⟪k:1⟫which he did not take kindly to,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아마 ⟪k:1⟫내 그런 성격과 ⟪k:2⟫태도가…… 티가 났을 거야. ⟪k:3⟫그런 점이 ⟪k:4⟫숙부의 눈에 났지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0F9B4C2F_8D4B_457A_9E21_31B09E682CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8706dde3574f246ef8ad66b3bda43482bf94a201c0fea90107b610a2ab1a69d9
#. default-sha256: 1f9e80175a17455880ddf0ba5557c093faab11a32391a11b68739409ca758ab4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0F9B4C2F_8D4B_457A_9E21_31B09E682CB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So this is our new home, dearest Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫여기가 넬리랑 오라버니의 새 터전이구나!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C46DB12A_F1A6_4AEF_80D6_1C916DF0125C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e6f9aae7ab226c51dcdf11f4aa5ea4021c3db9ef13a37236b2305e95ba5f44d
#. default-sha256: e92e89fc8abbb93b74f333accd7bf72fb3016c97225ae006876a944f6a3e9411
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C46DB12A_F1A6_4AEF_80D6_1C916DF0125C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BA103644_E5BA_4A61_A657_15137CCE2AB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56efd510e1d89b6de325692d360a0dc1ddad29cf2ffef7f03d647467a9e0ec58
#. default-sha256: 2c280a15363f8e38a2cc9016a90cda5049d50eb8334e28d4b7b17e7a9be27e1a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BA103644_E5BA_4A61_A657_15137CCE2AB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not going to go and say you want to return home in a couple months when you realize "
"life isn’t as luxurious here as it was back there, are you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫진짜로 괜찮겠어? ⟪k:1⟫나를 ⟪k:2⟫따라온 이상, ⟪k:3⟫더는…… 그 집에서 살던 시절처럼 좋은 생활을 "
"못 하는데."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D53E37F5_E62E_43EB_85DE_F5F5852B0380
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94c23f97ea35736118d8eb6a9a2ba142f7cf88c7bd43fa40d8bd5065272c4587
#. default-sha256: 1c7f1bc10a6679d784d1a84a0645e4c5b9cb414bd5203b3d61e32a77c5745a8d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D53E37F5_E62E_43EB_85DE_F5F5852B0380"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There’s only one thing in the whole wide world I really need."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫넬리가 진심으로 원하는 건 ⟪k:2⟫세상에서 딱 하나 뿐이거든."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9C7B0D6_955F_47A6_A1B6_B3B638AA981D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fecec0694087fd3297d07a500c60fc5b66306861c907cc083037e89161de053
#. default-sha256: 2583c12e75cff33655c209e8ae0ef07ab6ad36855deb252f73a7b6c39813eb50
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E9C7B0D6_955F_47A6_A1B6_B3B638AA981D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe. I’m as happy as I’ve ever been.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I don’t need all that fancy, expensive "
"stuff."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫후훗, ⟪k:2⟫넬리는 지금 ⟪k:3⟫오히려 행복해.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫사치스러운 생활은 필요 없어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D08E366E_EA6D_46C9_9B0F_8668427BDBE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adfe3125d49fafccb4944025b2639dff6598773649fdd7e22c4ef0ed71d7cbcd
#. default-sha256: de734a3403866eda7247dd086d4d528bd1ed27702c90170d1e71eb012a6891f2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D08E366E_EA6D_46C9_9B0F_8668427BDBE3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nellie..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫넬리……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4628AC94_86B1_412F_AF1B_3E7270C71B3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b48346f00676f44eb93ae3cfe21df635237fb11a3a247bdc40eaeb0de05f3ef9
#. default-sha256: baab17f201fd6b384f2090441fcd3c6fc43cd90cb0928551973a5f3f66c078c8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4628AC94_86B1_412F_AF1B_3E7270C71B3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……후훗……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66fce231c360881212a1d8e1ad987f9413773ee62fea56d21c4d0de83ac50d4d
#. default-sha256: 1d45ba46d84c80caede9d90e0fe506605a9d7a3a24699b119e4857320d861253
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wha— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That can’t be right...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I’m sure I’ve been smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어, ⟪k:3⟫그, ⟪k:4⟫그래……? ⟪k:5⟫잘 웃던 것만 같은데……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdc355c2e3599a1a9c5c51bc26811af4ac2b42b100972f81f2e072a6848cc419
#. default-sha256: 5af09224bb213754ab38254cb8fbdaf3e2aee0bea4d7922825b7fd2dae4f8a39
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m really glad you decided to come with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫고마워, ⟪k:1⟫넬리. ⟪k:2⟫네가 있어 줘서 다행이야."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a32175a5878d844917b08ef69f2cdee64f55ed8c5ef1e0d5e728eb85ff304fc0
#. default-sha256: 254532cd8d998a5d9d4b78f50a043cdfc8b0cc302514b1c770b3fbc4fb32c971
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Until that day, I had never known how good it felt to have someone who wanted me "
"in their life—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫누군가가 내 존재를 원한단 사실과――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫나를 봐 준단 사실이――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3502803fcf5c74c33ac063fa420f265552477b67b05b61350b93dc0d06babef0
#. default-sha256: 13216b6374ddee944926dcad2e51ecacf6429db38d4c983c7d8520066e8d916f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫who saw me for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이토록 ⟪k:1⟫기쁘단 걸 ⟪k:2⟫처음 알았어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39640e38bad7fe285bbadd9136d238b238b56d63da890103b24abffefdec9695
#. default-sha256: 923a2c2c6ce94d27c06f011cb770ac1296642939fdb4d397414e38652f09de40
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was hardly prince material—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t strong or handsome or regal enough for that—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 왕자님이 아니라…… ⟪k:1⟫훨씬 초라하고 한심한 존재였지만――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ad47f075291cc11390d81a2fc71265cfae75641348267edfb05c8296cea2388
#. default-sha256: 019d2d6e98653d26871c06626501c615bbb26487311de0559508b2a41cfcccee
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I’m staying home because I want to be with you as much as possible.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지금은 넬리 곁에 있고 싶어서⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫외출을 자제하는 거야――."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fef5036d5a52b4c0e6314e925681913bbec0358a039299c740c8b8b470b15f3d
#. default-sha256: 7a836ba16c7bf025ead78f6658e9bb46787c87462a65661f62cad88e4878570a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Welcome home, dearest Mell! What did you buy today?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫앗, ⟪k:4⟫어서 와, 오라버니! ⟪k:5⟫오늘은 뭘 사 왔어?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88f1afd0384e19920a6b7c8a8d381385427270d27faff43538e4e2883f8ebb5f
#. default-sha256: 33e1f64065af37b8b4f0e8d5ac0f80122f00a152ef3e5a5828747b54c5f06ac6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wow! I’ve never seen one so up close before!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are we going to keep it as a pet?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫와아, ⟪k:2⟫넬리는 ⟪k:3⟫닭을 이렇게 가까이에서 보는 건 ⟪k:4⟫처음이야! ⟪k:5⟫이 애를 ⟪k:6⟫"
"어쩌게? ⟪k:7⟫기르게?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B6DAF2C0_14E5_41D0_9248_6F5891F8439C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffd2a65bc1152be2045fdeecd92c878224f785512d47742a7fb7581956a37c28
#. default-sha256: 0a22c899b3db8e3a1a6a826d85b6ce7a0e60d158ead7780375409916026f3731
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B6DAF2C0_14E5_41D0_9248_6F5891F8439C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wha— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re... ⟪k:4⟫going to cook it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어……, ⟪k:2⟫이 애를…… 요리에 쓸 거야?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_46FE45DB_48F9_4B11_A5B7_E9CFA7AAD163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0afcc5295d9965421f05cd75626ebccd396fd966fca14313180f1e17af6af9ac
#. default-sha256: 90538024ccc26d33f755bd8e0344d07f22708f0a18b0217d367197fb77678e44
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_46FE45DB_48F9_4B11_A5B7_E9CFA7AAD163"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E681D104_B68C_446D_B5FE_E46E6C1477B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: daa9812a7dd74e90e1105f5ecea655a88f58ffb63f2d2b257df231c108b474d0
#. default-sha256: 24c78e87ce21e51f1e12b6656c2558fbbacffdca0d31b2b182796d0a812a3251
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E681D104_B68C_446D_B5FE_E46E6C1477B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But it’s all... ⟪k:2⟫covered in feathers and flapping about...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How are we "
"supposed to cook it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도…… ⟪k:2⟫깃털도 푹신하고 ⟪k:3⟫팔팔하게 움직이는데……, ⟪k:4⟫이 애를 어떻게 요리해야 "
"할까."

#: scenario8:scenario8_30426D9F_11EC_4A91_8E52_B06B67C70361
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97483d559eda27bd0ba1783734572925a4430a32cb242da187b7b3abaae81a6e
#. default-sha256: 537cfd4d0b6f5d2ea6e5b3edec1f04a2f04c82e9c3cef11633d9ba9303c237d2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30426D9F_11EC_4A91_8E52_B06B67C70361"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eeeeeew! No way! Absolutely not! Not in a million years!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫싫어~! ⟪k:2⟫못 해! ⟪k:3⟫죽어도 못 해!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫넬리는 ⟪k:6⟫그런 짓 못 해!!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CBA189C6_D4F7_4EBA_A64C_A8A869AB74C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf961c85b2291e0a1104441bba8ec45341861a525596f7fab185d6d0aaae4169
#. default-sha256: 88e2ba4c845b6cc8eedd325cb5702a9926b475c0d56db35d9b12cec929e5b534
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CBA189C6_D4F7_4EBA_A64C_A8A869AB74C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, please... ⟪k:1⟫please don’t put up a fight..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫날뛰지 말자~……, ⟪k:1⟫제발……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E0FF32B2_BEF8_47AC_BADC_C9A0BA265F09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89fcdd25b770063ae6cb64fd38a7ffcdefeabb7d16d752fa1d0923493433bf14
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
