"⟪k:0⟫She had visibly lost weight, and I had never heard her voice so weak and lethargic before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫늘 정신없이 밝았는데……, ⟪k:1⟫넬리의 목소리가 이렇게 여렸나 싶을 만큼 ⟪k:2⟫눈에 띄게 쇠약해졌"
