msgstr "⟪k:0⟫잘 설명하긴 힘든데…… ⟪k:1⟫마법 같았지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3ABFADF2_D3A0_4461_809E_E3289258B560
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
